> On nodes where no workload is present, traffic should not be dropped but load balanced by kube proxy to the target Service endpoints.

As far as my limited understanding of nftables goes, based on the fix: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/132456 the chain that should be implementing the short circuit for local traffic to external addresses is:

```
        chain filter-forward {
                type filter hook forward priority filter; policy accept;
                ct state new jump service-endpoints-check
                ct state new jump cluster-ips-check
        }
```

